## Downloaded models

Speech and transcription models are **not** part of the application. They are downloaded at
your request from their publishers and carry their own licences, which you are responsible for
observing. Notably, the Piper voice **ru_RU-ruslan** was trained on the
[RUSLAN corpus](https://ruslan-corpus.github.io/), licensed **CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 —
non-commercial use only**, and **ru_RU-irina**'s training data has no declared licence.
whisper's GGML weights are MIT, and GigaAM is MIT.
